    "Dang Yanbao is the chairman of Ningxia Baofeng Energy Group, a supplier of coal chemical products.",
    "He worked in building materials and investment before setting up Baofeng Energy in 2005.",
    "Another private firm, Baofeng Energy Storage, began trial production at its 100GWh battery and energy-storage plant in northwestern China's Yinchuan city in 2024.",
    "In 2025, Baofeng Energy began operations at a $6.7 billion olefins plant in Inner Mongolia, one of the world's largest, raising the company's annual capacity for olefin to 5.2 million tons."
